<title>GERMANY: Physicians seek to close down German nuclear plant.</title>
<headline>Physicians seek to close down German nuclear plant.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Germans physicians have filed a civil action to close down a nuclear power plant in northern Germany alleging the plant is responsible for a high number of cancer cases in the area, a lawyer said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dr. Hajo Dieckmann and Dr. Hans-Ulrich Clever seek to close down and withdraw the operating licence of the Kruemmel nuclear power plant in the coastal state of Schleswig-Holstein, charging radioactive emissions from the plant are directly responsible for the high local incidence of leukemia.</p>
</text>
